    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Double Arc Swing hangs two yellow seats from a teal frame that curves over the top in a wide arch. It is meant for the 6 to 12 years Key User Group and carries two children. The arch gives the swing a clean, modern look that suits a new society garden or a school entrance lawn. The frame measures 9'4\" x 3'7\" and needs a safe play area of 11'4\" x 13'2\", most of it in front of and behind the seats. The colour is Horizon Teal. Swinging builds rhythm and coordination, and two seats let friends swing side by side. Galvanised pipes carry a 3-year warranty and bearings a 1-year warranty. Send us your site photos for a layout."
     }
    ]
   }
